      "text": "\u2022 authorization: player JWT or service token, not forwarded\n\u2022 every request \u2192 Message Broker (service token, X-Timeout-Ms)\n\u2022 internal-only routes not exposed (404) \u00b7 concurrency limit\n\u2022 WebSocket negotiation (signed 60 s ticket)",
      "originalText": "\u2022 authorization: player JWT or service token, not forwarded\n\u2022 every request \u2192 Message Broker (service token, X-Timeout-Ms)\n\u2022 internal-only routes not exposed (404) \u00b7 concurrency limit\n\u2022 WebSocket negotiation (signed 60 s ticket)",
