      "text": "Python \u00b7 in-memory registry \u00b7 single instance \u00b7 not behind the Gateway or the Broker",
      "originalText": "Python \u00b7 in-memory registry \u00b7 single instance \u00b7 not behind the Gateway or the Broker",
