      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791752580617,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Notes",
      "originalText": "Notes",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b1o",
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "elq4c6i1v4zua6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1900,
      "y": 1796,
      "width": 690.0600000000001,
      "height": 105.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1343076642,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1695519225,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791752580617,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\u2022 Circuit breaker in the Message Broker, per instance and per service: 3 failures within\n   UPSTREAM_TIMEOUT_MS \u00d7 3.5 \u2192 report the instance \u2192 Service Discovery marks it removed.\n\u2022 Reroute only when safe: never sent (any method), counted 5xx (idempotent HTTP only);\n   gRPC only before the request was sent. One timeout budget across attempts.\n\u2022 Events: at-least-once, idempotent receivers (event id); retries with backoff, then the DLC.\n\u2022 Service Discovery is the one REST exception to \"everything through the Gateway\".",
      "originalText": "\u2022 Circuit breaker in the Message Broker, per instance and per service: 3 failures within\n   UPSTREAM_TIMEOUT_MS \u00d7 3.5 \u2192 report the instance \u2192 Service Discovery marks it removed.\n\u2022 Reroute only when safe: never sent (any method), counted 5xx (idempotent HTTP only);\n   gRPC only before the request was sent. One timeout budget across attempts.\n\u2022 Events: at-least-once, idempotent receivers (event id); retries with backoff, then the DLC.\n\u2022 Service Discovery is the one REST exception to \"everything through the Gateway\".",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b1p",
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
