      "text": "Message Broker :3011 \u00b7 gRPC :50011",
      "originalText": "Message Broker :3011 \u00b7 gRPC :50011",
      "fontSize": 26,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "aA",
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "l43eb7f51c46e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1232.07,
      "y": 553,
      "width": 615.86,
      "height": 17.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1003628287,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1071495319,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791752580617,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Python \u00b7 grpcio \u00b7 a thread per request, HTTP and gRPC \u00b7 2 levels of circuit breaker",
      "originalText": "Python \u00b7 grpcio \u00b7 a thread per request, HTTP and gRPC \u00b7 2 levels of circuit breaker",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "aB",
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "l43ec6bced784",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1120,
      "y": 583,
      "width": 690.0600000000001,
      "height": 70.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 885760656,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 807210256,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791752580617,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\u2022 forwards every request (HTTP) and service-to-service call (gRPC) to a healthy instance\n\u2022 least-loaded instance (load from Service Discovery + open requests) \u00b7 reroute when safe\n\u2022 topic queues: session.ended \u00b7 decision.recorded \u00b7 applicant.created \u2192 each subscriber\n\u2022 retries with backoff \u2192 Dead Letter Channel \u00b7 GET /topics \u00b7 GET /dead-letters \u00b7 GET /metrics",
      "originalText": "\u2022 forwards every request (HTTP) and service-to-service call (gRPC) to a healthy instance\n\u2022 least-loaded instance (load from Service Discovery + open requests) \u00b7 reroute when safe\n\u2022 topic queues: session.ended \u00b7 decision.recorded \u00b7 applicant.created \u2192 each subscriber\n\u2022 retries with backoff \u2192 Dead Letter Channel \u00b7 GET /topics \u00b7 GET /dead-letters \u00b7 GET /metrics",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "aC",
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
